<[Len] NMORGENSTERN> 1. It is tied to a certain version of Forth, and
<[Len] NMORGENSTERN> does not always match what you will see in F83
<[Len] NMORGENSTERN> 2) It describes an old type of editor. F83 and
<[Len] NMORGENSTERN> almost every other Forth now in existence has a more
